<p>1+</p>
<p>I like this. I really, really do. It's horror, but not the squicky kind. Losing your ability to do some that brings you joy, something you make a living with or something you're simply good at is a special kind of fear. What makes it even worse is this can easily happen via non-anomalous means. Brain injuries can happen to anyone. The symptoms from exposure appear to match.</p>
<p>Also, I enjoyed seeing a GOI (especially one like AWCY) feeling the logical consequences of their actions. If you're a dick, you're eventually going to piss someone off who can harm you in return. And they may just not care they'll get caught in crossfire.</p>

