			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4425054">
									

<p>To me, this does work as a sort of commentary on elitism in art (at least that's how I understood it). Alex caring more about preventing art he disapproves than making art himself feels particularly fitting. Articles about people mocking/criticizing AWCY? are quite abundant at this point, but I do like what this particular article does.</p>
<p>Also, I would have enjoyed seeing more of how people affected by the anomaly actually deal with the loss of their abilities (particularly someone like a member of AWCY, who would likely define themselves based on their artistry). However, given the direction the article takes, I can see that it may not have fit with the intended story very well.</p>

